<title>INDONESIA: ETERINDO SAYS H1 NET 43.67 BLN RPH.</title>
<headline>ETERINDO SAYS H1 NET 43.67 BLN RPH.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>				     (in billion rupiah)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     43.67</p>
<p>    Net Revenues			  212.52</p>
<p>    Gross profit			   83.74</p>
<p>    Income from operations	     66.66</p>
<p>    Charges				  (6.98)</p>
<p>    Provision for income tax	    8.19</p>
<p>    Minority interest		    (7.81)</p>
<p>Note: PT Eterindo Wahanatama Tbk is a chemical company which was listed on the Jakarta bourse in May this year. It did not provide comparative figures but said full-year 1996 net profit was 25.16 billion rupiah. The six-month figures were unaudited.</p>
</text>
